# Allowlist: ignore everything, then un-ignore each tracked file explicitly.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

# the tools
!sdcard.py
!integrity.py
!exfat_scan.py
!validate_entries.py
!exfat_extract.py
!test_sdcard.py

# CI
# '*' above matches at every directory level, so each new file under .github/
# needs its own '!' line or it is committed as nothing. The glob covers further
# workflows; anything else there (dependabot.yml, CODEOWNERS, issue templates)
# has to be added by name.
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml

# Deliberately NOT tracked:
#   canon_split.json  - generated run data; a list of absolute paths to photos
#   __pycache__/      - build artefact
#   *.json            - recovered_entries / validated_entries are run output
